==Description==
'''Accelerator Champion Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in the [[PVP Season 0]] as a reward for getting to Major III rank.

==Appearance==
The '''Accelerator Champion Charm''' appearance is based on the {{Color|Other|Champion}} [[Accelerator]] skin floating in the air. It also features a golden sparking aura emitting from it. Placing it down makes it play a sound when that skin is being placed.

The color of the '''Accelerator Champion Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is golden in its preview in the inventory.

